{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__calendar#card-zh","repo":"JohnXu22786/calendar","commit":"e675a4d280fe4ce375d1fa983a7da62e0c62d861","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-calendar 是面向 DSH 的日历插件，通过 Cordis bundle 注册日历工具，并连接兼容 CalDAV 的日历服务。它可查询、搜索、创建、修改和删除日程，处理重复事件与单次例外，并检查时间冲突；还可查询中国节日和干支生肖，生成可交给 DSH 定时工具的提醒计划。适合希望在 DSH 对话中管理远程日历、安排周期会议或查看节日信息的用户。使用前需配置 CalDAV 地址及认证信息，或使用 Google OAuth；默认时区为 Asia/Shanghai。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:83-116","src/tools.ts:68-246","src/service.ts:73-123"]}
{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__calendar#card-en","repo":"JohnXu22786/calendar","commit":"e675a4d280fe4ce375d1fa983a7da62e0c62d861","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-calendar connects DSH to CalDAV. It lists, searches, creates, updates, and deletes events, supports recurring schedules and single-instance edits, and checks conflicts. It reports Chinese holidays and prepares reminders. Set CalDAV credentials or use Google OAuth; timezone defaults to Shanghai.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:83-116","src/tools.ts:68-246","src/service.ts:73-123"]}
